{"id":"a30d4636dff880fb","group":"92","path":"92/92-df-satisfiable.md","title":"Satisfiable","display":"df-satisfiable — Satisfiable","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Gödel's Incompleteness Theorems","book_abbrev":"92","label":"92-df-satisfiable","aliases":["92-df-satisfiable"],"display":"df-satisfiable — Satisfiable","depends_on":["[[92-df-model]]","[[92-df-sentence]]","[[92-df-assignment]]","[[92-df-interpretation]]"],"source":"本地算术结构的 Tarski 语义；对照原书第 II 章 pp.18–19 的指定解释；任意结构版本是本地展开","source_status":"原书解释概念的本地语义扩展"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Gödel's Incompleteness Theorems"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"92"},{"key":"label","html":"92-df-satisfiable"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>92-df-satisfiable</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-satisfiable — Satisfiable"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"fd60117fc80e6f95\" href=\"?note=fd60117fc80e6f95\" title=\"92-df-model\">92-df-model</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"90f32e29c9d553ed\" href=\"?note=90f32e29c9d553ed\" title=\"92-df-sentence\">92-df-sentence</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"fdcbc43c728f79fc\" href=\"?note=fdcbc43c728f79fc\" title=\"92-df-assignment\">92-df-assignment</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"2b7f27c890af1dc3\" href=\"?note=2b7f27c890af1dc3\" title=\"92-df-interpretation\">92-df-interpretation</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source","html":"本地算术结构的 Tarski 语义；对照原书第 II 章 pp.18–19 的指定解释；任意结构版本是本地展开"},{"key":"source_status","html":"原书解释概念的本地语义扩展"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\varphi\\in\\mathrm{Sent}_G\">\\(\\varphi\\in\\mathrm{Sent}_G\\)</span> (sentence, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"90f32e29c9d553ed\" href=\"?note=90f32e29c9d553ed\" title=\"92-df-sentence\">92-df-sentence</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Struc}_G\">\\(\\mathrm{Struc}_G\\)</span> (structure class, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"fd60117fc80e6f95\" href=\"?note=fd60117fc80e6f95\" title=\"92-df-model\">92-df-model</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Assign}_G\">\\(\\mathrm{Assign}_G\\)</span> (assignment constructor, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"fdcbc43c728f79fc\" href=\"?note=fdcbc43c728f79fc\" title=\"92-df-assignment\">92-df-assignment</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\models_G\">\\(\\models_G\\)</span> (satisfaction relation, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-8\" data-note=\"2b7f27c890af1dc3\" href=\"?note=2b7f27c890af1dc3\" title=\"92-df-interpretation\">92-df-interpretation</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Sat}_G\">\\(\\mathrm{Sat}_G\\)</span> (definition-target predicate)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}satisfiable} \\vdash\n\\mathrm{Sat}_G(\\varphi)\\Longleftrightarrow\n\\exists\\mathfrak M\\in\\mathrm{Struc}_G\\,\\exists\\beta\\in\\mathrm{Assign}_G(|\\mathfrak M|)\\;(\\mathfrak M,\\beta\\models_G\\varphi)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}satisfiable} \\vdash\n\\mathrm{Sat}_G(\\varphi)\\Longleftrightarrow\n\\exists\\mathfrak M\\in\\mathrm{Struc}_G\\,\\exists\\beta\\in\\mathrm{Assign}_G(|\\mathfrak M|)\\;(\\mathfrak M,\\beta\\models_G\\varphi)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>关键符号：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>可满足：存在模型使句子为真</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\exists \\mathfrak{M}\\, (\\mathfrak{M} \\models \\varphi)\">\\(\\exists \\mathfrak{M}\\, (\\mathfrak{M} \\models \\varphi)\\)</span></li>\n<li>对标准可靠且完备的一阶演算，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Sat}_G(\\varphi)\">\\(\\mathrm{Sat}_G(\\varphi)\\)</span>当且仅当单元素理论<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\{\\varphi\\}\">\\(\\{\\varphi\\}\\)</span>句法相容；这里必须说明所指的是该理论而非把“公式”和“一致性谓词”直接等同</li>\n<li>不可满足：矛盾式</li>\n<li>例：<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\varphi \\land \\neg\\varphi\">\\(\\varphi \\land \\neg\\varphi\\)</span>不可满足</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"0=S(0)\">\\(0=S(0)\\)</span>在标准自然数结构中为假，但作为纯<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"G\">\\(G\\)</span>-语言句子仍有非常规结构使它为真，故它本身并非不可满足；加入<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"Q\">\\(Q\\)</span>中<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\forall x\\,S(x)\\neq0\">\\(\\forall x\\,S(x)\\neq0\\)</span>等公理后才排除这些结构</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"92-df-model","status":"resolved","id":"fd60117fc80e6f95","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[92-df-model]]","embed":false},{"target":"92-df-sentence","status":"resolved","id":"90f32e29c9d553ed","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[92-df-sentence]]","embed":false},{"target":"92-df-assignment","status":"resolved","id":"fdcbc43c728f79fc","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[92-df-assignment]]","embed":false},{"target":"92-df-interpretation","status":"resolved","id":"2b7f27c890af1dc3","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[92-df-interpretation]]","embed":false},{"target":"92-df-sentence","status":"resolved","id":"90f32e29c9d553ed","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\varphi\\in\\mathrm{Sent}_G$ (sentence, see [[92-df-sentence]])","embed":false},{"target":"92-df-model","status":"resolved","id":"fd60117fc80e6f95","anchor":"ref-6","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Struc}_G$ (structure class, see [[92-df-model]])","embed":false},{"target":"92-df-assignment","status":"resolved","id":"fdcbc43c728f79fc","anchor":"ref-7","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Assign}_G$ (assignment constructor, see [[92-df-assignment]])","embed":false},{"target":"92-df-interpretation","status":"resolved","id":"2b7f27c890af1dc3","anchor":"ref-8","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\models_G$ (satisfaction relation, see [[92-df-interpretation]])","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"\\varphi\\in\\mathrm{Sent}_G","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Struc}_G","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Assign}_G","display":false},{"tex":"\\models_G","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Sat}_G","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}satisfiable} \\vdash\n\\mathrm{Sat}_G(\\varphi)\\Longleftrightarrow\n\\exists\\mathfrak M\\in\\mathrm{Struc}_G\\,\\exists\\beta\\in\\mathrm{Assign}_G(|\\mathfrak M|)\\;(\\mathfrak M,\\beta\\models_G\\varphi)","display":true},{"tex":"\\exists \\mathfrak{M}\\, (\\mathfrak{M} \\models \\varphi)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Sat}_G(\\varphi)","display":false},{"tex":"\\{\\varphi\\}","display":false},{"tex":"\\varphi \\land \\neg\\varphi","display":false},{"tex":"0=S(0)","display":false},{"tex":"G","display":false},{"tex":"Q","display":false},{"tex":"\\forall x\\,S(x)\\neq0","display":false}],"bytes":1702,"backlinks":[{"id":"823a52c75bbad9bd","anchor":"ref-153","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[92-df-satisfiable]]"}],"outgoing":["fd60117fc80e6f95","90f32e29c9d553ed","fdcbc43c728f79fc","2b7f27c890af1dc3"]}